  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Steps away from one of the prettiest beaches in the world. Tons of amazing dining, shopping and adventures await - only a bike ride away off the beautiful 30-A!<br><br>The sound of the surf is accompanied most often by a gentle gulf breeze and warmth of the sun and always by breathtaking views from the main level deck and the large bedroom balcony.<br><br>Pristine sugar white sand and blue green water beacons for beach walks, wading, swimming, fishing, and more. This 'peace' of paradise is located on a tucked away beach, yet it is less than five minutes from Seaside and/or Rosemary and Grayton Beaches with fabulous restaurants, nightlife, and all the activity you could desire. But try to be back at Beachfront for the spectacular sunsets which confirm you've actually found paradise.<br><br>Further Details: Wake up to a clear view of the gulf from the king-size bed in the large bedroom and/or step out onto large bedroom balcony to check out the day's temperature and beach breeze. A second bedroom has a full bed plus a bunkbed with a trundle. Each bedroom has its own full bath plus a generous supply of bed linens and towels.<br><br>Full-size washer and dryer, covered parking, barbecue grill with picnic table, bike trails, nearby nature preserve/state park, and a freshwater lake adjoining the rear of the property are but a few of the amenities available at this wonderful vacation town home.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Peace of Paradise - Magnificent Gulf View!"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
